{
    "title": "randstad: jobs for workers",
    "description": "Tired of wondering who\u2019s on the other end of your job applications? With the Randstad app you can stop waiting for someone to respond and take control of your job search with FREE 24/7 access to jobs near you, delivered right to your mobile device.  \r\n\r\nFind flexible jobs near you with this new self-service option. Our Randstad app is rapidly expanding across the US. If you do not currently see jobs in your area, we\u2019ll be there soon!\r\n\r\nWHY CHOOSE randstad: jobs for workers \r\n- get 24/7 access to jobs near you \r\n- real time updates of job openings that you are qualified for\r\n- you decide what job(s) to take and what shifts to sign up for\r\n- know the hourly pay rate, company, location, and job requirements upfront\r\n- easy access to upcoming shifts and assignments\r\n- confirm shifts or call off if you are no longer able to work\r\n- rate clients after completing a shift\r\n\r\nDO IT ALL FROM THE APP:\r\nStart a new job right! Everything is easy from your device including: background checks (if needed), identity verification, and more. Receive all of the benefits of being a Randstad employee without the wait.\r\n\r\nOTHER BENEFITS AT YOUR FINGERTIPS:\r\n- enter hours worked and break times\r\n- easily view pay stub info\r\n- push notifications and reminders\r\n- invitations to accept shifts from previous clients\r\n- keep your contact info up to date\r\n- refer a friend and earn a referral fee\r\n\r\nYour next career move is literally in your hands. Download the app and get started right away!\r\n\u00a1Disponible en Espa\u00f1ol!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tired of wondering who\u2019s on the other end of your job applications? With the Randstad app you can stop waiting for someone to respond and take control of your job search with FREE 24/7 access to jobs near you, delivered right to your mobile device.  <br><br>Find flexible jobs near you with this new self-service option. Our Randstad app is rapidly expanding across the US. If you do not currently see jobs in your area, we\u2019ll be there soon!<br><br>WHY CHOOSE randstad: jobs for workers <br>- get 24/7 access to jobs near you <br>- real time updates of job openings that you are qualified for<br>- you decide what job(s) to take and what shifts to sign up for<br>- know the hourly pay rate, company, location, and job requirements upfront<br>- easy access to upcoming shifts and assignments<br>- confirm shifts or call off if you are no longer able to work<br>- rate clients after completing a shift<br><br>DO IT ALL FROM THE APP:<br>Start a new job right! Everything is easy from your device including: background checks (if needed), identity verification, and more. Receive all of the benefits of being a Randstad employee without the wait.<br><br>OTHER BENEFITS AT YOUR FINGERTIPS:<br>- enter hours worked and break times<br>- easily view pay stub info<br>- push notifications and reminders<br>- invitations to accept shifts from previous clients<br>- keep your contact info up to date<br>- refer a friend and earn a referral fee<br><br>Your next career move is literally in your hands. Download the app and get started right away!<br>\u00a1Disponible en Espa\u00f1ol!",
